{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48189","headline":"题潼关普通院门 · 陈季卿","name":"题潼关普通院门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"度关悲失志，万绪乱心机。\n下坂马无力，扫门尘满衣。\n计谋多不就，心口自相违。\n已作羞归计，还胜羞不归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈季卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48189.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48189","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}